flowchart TD
    A[File I/O Streams] --> B[ofstream - write]
    A --> C[ifstream - read]
    A --> D[fstream - read/write]

    B --> E[open / close]
    B --> F[insertion operator <<]
    C --> E
    C --> G[extraction operator >>]

    H[File Open Modes] --> I[ios::in]
    H --> J[ios::out]
    H --> K[ios::app]
    H --> L[ios::ate]
    H --> M[ios::trunc]
    H --> N[ios::binary]

    O[Text Mode] --> P[Read/write formatted data]
    O --> Q[Automatic newline translation]

    R[Binary Mode] --> S[Read/write raw bytes]
    R --> T[use read / write member functions]
    R --> U[No formatting applied]

    V[File Positioning] --> W[tellg / tellp]
    V --> X[seekg / seekp]
    X --> Y[beg / cur / end offset]

    Z[Serialization] --> AA[Write object data byte-by-byte]
    Z --> AB[Handle endianness]
    Z --> AC[Version compatibility]

    AD[Error Handling] --> AE[good / fail / bad / eof]
    AD --> AF[Check after every operation]
